Now speaking of increasing resolutions,

01:18:30.661 --> 01:18:31.862
we didn't stop there.

01:18:32.972 --> 01:18:35.111
We took the learnings that we got from Quake and applied

01:18:35.111 --> 01:18:37.272
it to our bleeding edge dataset. We

01:18:37.272 --> 01:18:39.291
now have a one point o.

01:18:40.412 --> 01:18:42.592
Model which is working at x year resolution.

