Maybe it makes sense to you. Hopefully, it does.

02:00:06.052 --> 02:00:08.232
In r l, pretty much any algorithm

02:00:08.292 --> 02:00:10.731
for learning to do control can be decomposed

02:00:11.032 --> 02:00:12.572
into three basic parts.

