world. Then there is a stage

02:00:21.952 --> 02:00:23.412
where you learn something.

02:00:24.732 --> 02:00:26.882
For example, you fit a model. Even model

02:00:26.882 --> 02:00:28.961
free algorithms still learn something. Maybe

02:00:28.962 --> 02:00:31.032
their model very rudimentary. Maybe it's something like a

