02:00:33.362 --> 02:00:35.442
Of course, if we're concerned with world models, this is

02:00:35.442 --> 02:00:37.521
the box that's typically going to have the most interesting

02:00:37.521 --> 02:00:39.472
stuff. So fit something

02:00:39.532 --> 02:00:41.472
that models something about the world.

02:00:42.232 --> 02:00:44.472
Then use that thing you just fitted to make

02:00:44.472 --> 02:00:46.652
